<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<title>Ticket de réparation {{ ticket.reference }}</title>

		<style>
			@page { margin: 28px 24px 24px; }

			body {
				font-family: DejaVu Sans, sans-serif;
				font-size: 12px;
				color: #1f2937;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				line-height: 1.45;
			}

			.wrapper { width: 100%; }
			.header {
				width: 100%;
				margin-bottom: 18px;
				border-bottom: 2px solid #0d6efd;
				padding-bottom: 14px;
			}
			.header-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
			.header-left { width: 65%; vertical-align: top; }
			.header-right { width: 35%; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; }
			.logo { height: 70px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
			.company-name { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 4px; }
			.company-meta { font-size: 11px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0; }
			.document-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 8px; }
			.reference-box {
				display: inline-block;
				background: #eff6ff;
				border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
				color: #1d4ed8;
				font-size: 12px;
				font-weight: bold;
				padding: 6px 10px;
				border-radius: 6px;
			}
			.meta { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280; }
			.section { margin-bottom: 16px; }
			.section-title {
				font-size: 13px;
				font-weight: bold;
				color: #111827;
				background: #f3f4f6;
				border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
				padding: 8px 10px;
				margin-bottom: 8px;
			}
			.info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
			.info-table td {
				vertical-align: top;
				padding: 6px 8px;
				border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
			}
			.label {
				width: 32%;
				font-weight: bold;
				background: #f9fafb;
				color: #374151;
			}
			.value { width: 68%; color: #111827; }
			.price-table {
				width: 100%;
				border-collapse: collapse;
				margin-top: 4px;
			}
			.price-table th, .price-table td {
				border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
				padding: 10px;
				text-align: left;
			}
			.price-table th {
				background: #f3f4f6;
				font-size: 12px;
				color: #374151;
			}
			.price-table td {
				font-size: 13px;
				color: #111827;
				font-weight: bold;
			}
			.description-box {
				border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
				background: #fcfcfd;
				padding: 12px;
				min-height: 70px;
				white-space: pre-wrap;
				word-wrap: break-word;
			}
			.footer {
				margin-top: 28px;
				padding-top: 12px;
				border-top: 1px solid #d1d5db;
				font-size: 10px;
				color: #6b7280;
				text-align: center;
			}
			.small-note {
				font-size: 10px;
				color: #6b7280;
				margin-top: 8px;
			}
		</style>
	</head>

	<body>
		<div class="wrapper">
			<div class="header">
				<table class="header-table">
					<tr>
						<td class="header-left">
							{% if logoPath %}
								<img src="{{ logoPath }}" alt="IT-PRO" class="logo">
							{% endif %}

							<div class="company-name">IT-PRO</div>
							<p class="company-meta">Ticket SAV — Prise en charge réparation</p>
						</td>

						<td class="header-right">
							<div class="document-title">Ticket de réparation</div>
							<div class="reference-box">{{ ticket.reference }} — v{{ version }}</div>

							<div class="meta">
								Date du ticket : {{ generatedAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}
							</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<div class="section-title">Informations client</div>
				<table class="info-table">
					<tr>
						<td class="label">Nom complet</td>
						<td class="value">{{ ticket.client.firstName }} {{ ticket.client.lastName }}</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="label">Téléphone</td>
						<td class="value">{{ ticket.client.phone ?: '-' }}</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="label">Email</td>
						<td class="value">{{ ticket.client.email ?: '-' }}</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<div class="section-title">Équipement et panne déclarée</div>
				<table class="info-table">
					<tr>
						<td class="label">Équipement / modèle</td>
						<td class="value">{{ ticket.equipmentModel.name ?: '-' }}</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="label">Panne déclarée</td>
						<td class="value">{{ ticket.issue.name ?: '-' }}</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<div class="section-title">Informations financières</div>
				<table class="price-table">
					<tr>
						<th>Prix estimé</th>
						<th>Acompte</th>
						<th>Reste estimé</th>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>{{ ticket.price|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
						<td>
							{% set depositValue = ticket.deposit is not null ? ticket.deposit : 0 %}
							{{ depositValue|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €
						</td>
						<td>{{ (ticket.price - depositValue)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<div class="section-title">Description / observations</div>
				<div class="description-box">
					{{ ticket.description ?: 'Aucune description fournie.' }}
				</div>

				<div class="small-note">
					Le présent document constitue un justificatif de prise en charge. Les informations peuvent être mises à jour au cours du traitement du dossier.
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="footer">
				© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} SAV-IT-PRO — IT-PRO<br>
				Référence dossier : <strong>{{ ticket.reference }}</strong><br>
				Version PDF : <strong>{{ version }}</strong>
			</div>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>